<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULT/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULT/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-27</dateline>
